      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The same component fills the terrain's details: grass and small plants, by height and slope, with a seed for the pattern. It writes the same data as Paint Details, so the terrain still draws the grass only within the Detail Distance.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> The grass density is halved. Does the grass get thinner everywhere, or only in some places?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select Terrain 6; in Terrain Tree And Grass Rules, open the Grass-Tuft row under Grass.\n2. Halve its Density.\n3. Press Place Grass.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Toolbox \u203A Terrain Tree And Grass Rules \xB7 plants: LOLIPOP, CC BY 4.0 (Sketchfab)</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
